      "raw": "擦除：`erase = seg(t, 0.78, 0.9, E.outQuad)` 把 dashoffset 推成负值（`-erase*len`），"
    },
    {
      "ord": 15,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "于是虚线从**起点**方向退走，方向与 draw-on 相反，读作\"通路收回\""
    },
    {
      "ord": 16,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": [
        0.16,
        0.26
      ],
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "徽标：`seg(t, 0.16, 0.26)` 淡入并从 0.7 放到 1，吞并时刻（0.7→0.78 outBack 加 12%，"
    },
    {
      "ord": 17,
      "heading": "动效核心",
      "window": null,
      "frame_hints": [],
      "ease": null,
      "beziers": [],
      "raw": "0.78→0.86 outQuad 减回）做一次接收脉冲；末尾 `endCap` 字幕在 0.84 后淡入"
    }
  ],
